  {
    "id": "critic-ausgamers-8",
    "game": "red-dead-redemption-2",
    "review_type": "critic",
    "platform": "PC",
    "author": null,
    "publication": "AusGamers",
    "date": "2019-12-04",
    "score": 100,
    "text": "It’s been nine years since the MOTU race has had to read, listen to or watch the couch warriors carry on about this “amazing Western gaming experience”, but now, finally, it’s here and you can strap yourself into your desk chair and uncover the world of New Hanover and beyond. Just… take your time. It’s honestly still worth it, even over 1000 hours in single-player on.",
    "source": {
      "external_url": "https://www.ausgamers.com/games/red-dead-redemption-2-pc/review/"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "product_id": 1400579386,
      "product_title": "Red Dead Redemption 2",
      "publication_slug": "ausgamers",
      "critic_score_summary": {
        "url": "/game/red-dead-redemption-2/critic-reviews/?platform=pc",
        "score": 93
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "critic-gameplanet-9",
    "game": "red-dead-redemption-2",
    "review_type": "critic",
    "platform": "PC",
    "author": null,
    "publication": "Gameplanet",
    "date": "2019-12-03",
    "score": 95,
    "text": "Red Dead Redemption 2 on PC is the definitive version of Rockstar’s Western epic. The game has never looked as good, nor played as well. This is one of the best stories Rockstar has ever told, even if their storytelling has become a little predictable, but that cannot take away from how exceptional the whole package is it.",
    "source": {
      "external_url": "https://www.gameplanet.com.au/pc/reviews/g5de567915c377/Red-Dead-Redemption-2-PC-Review/"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "product_id": 1400579386,
      "product_title": "Red Dead Redemption 2",
      "publication_slug": "gameplanet",
      "critic_score_summary": {
        "url": "/game/red-dead-redemption-2/critic-reviews/?platform=pc",
        "score": 93
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "critic-hooked-gamers-10",
    "game": "red-dead-redemption-2",
    "review_type": "critic",
    "platform": "PC",
    "author": null,
    "publication": "Hooked Gamers",
    "date": "2019-11-27",
    "score": 93,
    "text": "When the game was released for the major consoles last year, I was annoyed. As a PC user, I was still waiting for Rockstar to release the original Red Dead Redemption on PC. Well, that never happened, and a year after the console versions were released, I was beginning to think that Red Dead Redemption 2 would suffer the same fate. But I’m happy to say that it has finally arrived, and it is a glorious cinematic gaming experience that was well worth the wait.",
    "source": {
      "external_url": "https://www.hookedgamers.com/pc/red_dead_redemption_2/review/article-2104.html"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "product_id": 1400579386,
      "product_title": "Red Dead Redemption 2",
      "publication_slug": "hooked-gamers",
      "critic_score_summary": {
        "url": "/game/red-dead-redemption-2/critic-reviews/?platform=pc",
        "score": 93
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "critic-game-over-online-11",
    "game": "red-dead-redemption-2",
    "review_type": "critic",
    "platform": "PC",
    "author": null,
    "publication": "Game Over Online",
    "date": "2019-11-26",
    "score": 90,
    "text": "I’m completely and totally immersed in this world, but at the same time kind of wondering about the “gameness” of what I’m doing, which is often less about thrilling adventure and more about Zen and the art of horseback riding, which makes it kind of a unique experience, and for me one worth having.",
    "source": {
      "external_url": "http://www.game-over.com/content/2019/11/red-dead-redemption-2-pc/#sthash.hG27hBUc.dpbs"
    },
    "metadata": {
