    "author": null,
    "publication": "PCGamesN",
    "date": "2019-11-07",
    "score": 100,
    "text": "PC is the best place to play last year’s best game. It’s massive yet loses no focus, epic on every level, and combines Rockstar’s penchant for immense detail with a surprising amount of heart.",
